    "enUS": {
      "description": "Back again, {name}?  If you have five more Wastewander water pouches, then I have a care package with your name on it!",
      "dialogue": {
        "0bec7ac22d70d4aaa68d": "Excellent - the more water pouches we are able to reclaim, the further away from disaster we'll all be!  Keep 'em coming, and I will be sure to reward you for every five water pouches you bring me.",
        "909d45e4471ca716dd08": "Back again, $n?  If you have five more Wastewander water pouches, then I have a care package with your name on it!"
      },
